                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s34IHA" type="acephalous"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1r">-1r</locus>عن امر ربهم فاخذتهم الصاعقة وهم ينظرون , فما استطاعوا من قيام وما كانوا منتصرين</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#17r">-17r</locus>وان الفضل بيد الله يؤتيه من يشاء والله ذو الفضل العظيم</explicit>
                     <note>51:44-57:29. Triple dots as verse markers. Titles of suras rubricated. Experienced hand playing constantly with upstrokes and downstrokes. Last letter of many words at the end of a line completed on the top of the word (i.e. not in the margin). Words and expressions, enhanced with red color (fol. 9r, 13r, 13v). Deletions, also in red color. Corrections in the margins by the same hand and another. No visible catchwords. Saǧda marker in red color (fol. 6v).</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
